# Shared editor extensions — installed into BOTH VS Code and Cursor.
# Install with: `make ext`
# Editor-locked extensions live in Extfile.vscode and Extfile.cursor.
#
# Every ID here must resolve on both the Microsoft Marketplace (VS Code) and
# OpenVSX (Cursor). If `make ext` reports an install failure, the extension is
# missing from one registry — move it to the per-editor file instead.

